-- compressed and restored
nothing: 0 bytes as 23 (0 coded, 1 stored), restored the same: true
one byte: 1 bytes as 24 (0 coded, 1 stored), restored the same: true
six lines of text: 285 bytes as 202 (1 coded, 0 stored), restored the same: true
the same twelve times: 3420 bytes as 231 (1 coded, 0 stored), restored the same: true
one byte five thousand times: 5000 bytes as 71 (1 coded, 0 stored), restored the same: true
bytes from a generator: 1500 bytes as 1523 (0 coded, 1 stored), restored the same: true
a table of four hundred rows: 16065 bytes as 3569 (1 coded, 0 stored), restored the same: true
