restored: hello, hello, hello, hello, kern
-- files that are not what they should be
an empty file: not a gzip file
a file of text: not a gzip file
the first half of a file: the file ends too soon
a file without its last byte: the file ends too soon
a file with one byte changed in the middle: the data is damaged
a file with one bit of its checksum changed: the checksum or the length does not match
two files one after the other: 6840 bytes, twice the text: true
